+    When ``with_counts`` is ``True``, each group is a three-field namedtuple
+    of ``(grouper, list, count)`` that supports ``.grouper``, ``.list``, and
+    ``.count`` attributes. The ``count`` is the number of items in the group.
+
+    .. sourcecode:: html+jinja
+
+        <ul>{% for grouper, items, count in users|groupby("city", with_counts=True) %}
+          <li>{{ grouper }} ({{ count }}): {{ items|join(", ") }}
